      "number": "Measure HOM",
      "title": "Create HOME Housing Overlays in Monterey Park",
      "level": "city",
      "type": "measure",
      "description": "Would amend the city's Land Use Element to create a Housing Overlay Mixed Environments (HOME) designation allowing housing (multifamily, townhomes, condos, mixed use) in identified commercial and industrial areas. It would not approve any project by itself, would not apply in R-1 or R-2 zones, and keeps the city's ban on data centers.",
